<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, shrink-to-fit=no">
    <title>카트 트랙 맞추기</title>
    <meta name="description" content="카트라이더 트랙 맞추기 퀴즈">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/boxicons@latest/css/boxicons.min.css">
</head>
<style>
    @font-face {
        font-family: nexon_bold;
        src: url(/font/nexon_bold.otf);
    }

    @font-face {
        font-family: nexon;
        src: url(/font/nexon.otf);
    }

    h1,
    h3 {
        margin-top: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        font-family: 'nexon_bold', sans-serif;
    }

    p {
        text-align: center;
        font-family: 'nexon', sans-serif;
    }

    .theme_check {
        text-align: center;
        font-family: 'nexon', sans-serif;
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .theme_check label {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 6px 10px;
        cursor: pointer;
    }

    form {
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
</style>

<body>
    <h1>카트라이더 트랙 맞추기</h1>
    <p>총 10개의 문제가 제공됩니다.<br>
        제시되는 트랙 이미지를 보고 트랙명을 정확하게 작성하면 됩니다.</p>
    <div class="alert alert-success" role="alert" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 20px auto; text-align: center;">
        원하는 테마를 선택하여 퀴즈를 풀어보세요! (선택하지 않으면 전체 테마에서 무작위 출제)
    </div>
    <h3>테마 선택</h3>
    <form action="/" method="post">
        <div class="theme_check">
            <div class="mb-3">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary me-2" onclick="toggleAll(true)">전체 선택</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" onclick="toggleAll(false)">전체 해제</button>
            </div>
            <div>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme1" value="1" checked> 1920</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme2" value="1" checked> WKC</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme3" value="1" checked> 공동묘지</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme4" value="1" checked> 광산</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme5" value="1" checked> 네모</label><br>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme6" value="1" checked> 노르테유</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme7" value="1" checked> 놀이동산</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme8" value="1" checked> 님프</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme9" value="1" checked> 대저택</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme10" value="1" checked> 도검</label><br>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme11" value="1" checked> 동화</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme12" value="1" checked> 마비노기</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme13" value="1" checked> 메카닉</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme14" value="1" checked> 문힐시티</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme15" value="1" checked> 브로디</label><br>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme16" value="1" checked> 비치</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme17" value="1" checked> 빌리지</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme18" value="1" checked> 사막</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme19" value="1" checked> 신화</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme20" value="1" checked> 아이스</label><br>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme21" value="1" checked> 어비스</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme22" value="1" checked> 올림포스</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme23" value="1" checked> 월드</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme24" value="1" checked> 쥐라기</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme25" value="1" checked> 차이나</label><br>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme26" value="1" checked> 카멜롯</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme27" value="1" checked> 코리아</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme28" value="1" checked> 팩토리</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme29" value="1" checked> 포레스트</label>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme30" value="1" checked> 해적</label><br>
                <label><input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" name="theme31" value="1" checked> 황금문명</label>
            </div>
            <br>
            <input type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg mt-2 px-5" value="게임 시작">
        </div>
    </form>

    <script>
        function toggleAll(checked) {
            document.querySelectorAll('.theme_check input[type="checkbox"]').forEach(function (cb) {
                cb.checked = checked;
            });
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
